    "Sign in once with your RetroAchievements account to earn achievements in RetroArch, DuckStation, PPSSPP, Dolphin and Flycast. Arcadia keeps only a sign-in token in your Keychain, never your password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سجّل الدخول مرة واحدة بحساب RetroAchievements لتحصل على الإنجازات في RetroArch وDuckStation وPPSSPP وDolphin وFlycast. يحتفظ Arcadia برمز تسجيل الدخول فقط في سلسلة المفاتيح، ولا يحتفظ بكلمة السر أبدًا."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inicia sesión una vez con tu cuenta de RetroAchievements para conseguir logros en RetroArch, DuckStation, PPSSPP, Dolphin y Flycast. Arcadia solo guarda un token de inicio de sesión en tu llavero, nunca tu contraseña."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connectez-vous une fois avec votre compte RetroAchievements pour obtenir des succès dans RetroArch, DuckStation, PPSSPP, Dolphin et Flycast. Arcadia ne conserve qu’un jeton de connexion dans votre trousseau, jamais votre mot de passe."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RetroArch, DuckStation, PPSSPP, Dolphin और Flycast में अचीवमेंट पाने के लिए अपने RetroAchievements खाते से एक बार साइन इन करें। Arcadia आपकी कीचेन में केवल एक साइन-इन टोकन रखता है, आपका पासवर्ड कभी नहीं।"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inicie sessão uma vez com sua conta do RetroAchievements para ganhar conquistas no RetroArch, DuckStation, PPSSPP, Dolphin e Flycast. O Arcadia guarda apenas um token de acesso nas suas Chaves, nunca a sua senha."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RetroArch, DuckStation, PPSSPP, Dolphin ve Flycast’te başarım kazanmak için RetroAchievements hesabınla bir kez giriş yap. Arcadia, Anahtar Zinciri’nde yalnızca bir giriş anahtarı saklar; parolanı asla saklamaz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用你的 RetroAchievements 账户登录一次，即可在 RetroArch、DuckStation、PPSSPP、Dolphin 和 Flycast 中获得成就。Arcadia 只会在你的钥匙串中保存登录令牌，绝不会保存你的密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed in as": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "مسجّل الدخول باسم"
          }
        },
        "es": {
