        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘上没有足够的可用空间来写入压缩副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This PS Vita game is encrypted and can't be installed without its license (sce_sys/package/work.bin). Dump it again with NoNpDrm or FAGDec.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لعبة PS Vita هذه مشفّرة ولا يمكن تثبيتها دون ترخيصها (sce_sys/package/work.bin). استخرجها مجددًا باستخدام NoNpDrm أو FAGDec."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este juego de PS Vita está cifrado y no se puede instalar sin su licencia (sce_sys/package/work.bin). Vuelve a extraerlo con NoNpDrm o FAGDec."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce jeu PS Vita est chiffré et ne peut pas être installé sans sa licence (sce_sys/package/work.bin). Extrayez-le à nouveau avec NoNpDrm ou FAGDec."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह PS Vita गेम एन्क्रिप्टेड है और इसके लाइसेंस (sce_sys/package/work.bin) के बिना इंस्टॉल नहीं हो सकता। इसे NoNpDrm या FAGDec से फिर से डंप करें।"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este jogo de PS Vita está criptografado e não pode ser instalado sem a licença (sce_sys/package/work.bin). Extraia-o novamente com o NoNpDrm ou o FAGDec."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu PS Vita oyunu şifreli ve lisansı (sce_sys/package/work.bin) olmadan yüklenemez. Oyunu NoNpDrm ya da FAGDec ile yeniden al."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 PS Vita 游戏已加密，没有其许可证（sce_sys/package/work.bin）无法安装。请用 NoNpDrm 或 FAGDec 重新转储。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
